## Building

### Prerequisites
- CMake 3.15 or higher
- A C++17 (or higher) compatible compiler

### Build Steps

1. Configure the project:
```bash
cmake -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE={{ build_type }}
```

2. Build the project:
```bash
cmake --build build --config {{ build_type }}
```

3. {% if project_type == "executable" %}Run the executable:
```bash
./build/{{ project_name | snake_case }}
```{% else %}Use the library:
The library will be built in `build/lib/` (or `build/` on Windows) and can be linked against other projects.{% endif %}

### Build Types

Available build types:
- `Debug`: Debug build with no optimizations
- `Release`: Optimized release build
- `RelWithDebInfo`: Release build with debug information